cff-version: 1.2.0
title: Brainfast
message: >-
  If you use Brainfast in academic work, please cite the software using the
  metadata from this file.
type: software
authors:
  - name: Brainfast contributors
repository-code: "https://github.com/Skiyoshika/Brainfast"
license: AGPL-3.0-only
version: "0.3.0-desktop"
date-released: "2026-03-30"
abstract: >-
  Brainfast is a workstation-oriented toolkit for Allen atlas registration,
  manual review, calibration learning, and whole-brain cell counting from
  cleared-tissue microscopy data.
keywords:
  - neuroscience
  - lightsheet
  - atlas registration
  - allen ccf
  - cell counting
